{"id": "68385", "title": "开个价[重生]", "author": "寒夜飘零", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 34, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68385.htm", "intro": "温文儒雅的周影帝穿成了肆意妄为的夏家二世祖，\r\n影帝淡定微笑：“没关系，我可以演。”\r\n\r\n习惯了低调做人的好人缘穿成了高调的惹人厌，\r\n影帝毫无压力：“没关系，我也可以演。”\r\n\r\n禁欲系直男却穿成了招蜂引蝶的纯GAY，\r\n影帝嘴角抽搐：“这个我必须拒演。”\r\n\r\n人生如戏却不是戏，在这场无法NG的狗血大戏里，其实影帝最没话语权。\r\n\r\n面瘫腹黑忠犬攻×变态亲和度爆表的直男受。\r\n\r\n\r\n友情提示：1、架空，纯属虚构，看个乐和，切勿较真。\r\n2、主受，1v1，温馨无虐。", "base": "files/article/html/68/68385", "chapters": [{"title": "冥婚", "file": "10526940.html", "available": false}, {"title": "被拐", "file": "10526941.html", "available": false}, {"title": "荒唐", "file": "10526942.html", "available": false}, {"title": "威胁", "file": "10526943.html", "available": false}, {"title": "提议", "file": "10526944.html", "available": false}, {"title": "你说", "file": "10526945.html", "available": false}, {"title": "入戏", "file": "10526946.html", "available": false}, {"title": "从良", "file": "10526947.html", "available": false}, {"title": "算计", "file": "10526948.html", "available": false}, {"title": "剖白", "file": "10526949.html", "available": false}, {"title": "难辨", "file": "10526950.html", "available": false}, {"title": "反串", "file": "10526951.html", "available": false}, {"title": "相见", "file": "10526952.html", "available": false}, {"title": "厚礼", "file": "10526953.html", "available": false}, {"title": "纵容", "file": "10526954.html", "available": false}, {"title": "约定", "file": "10526955.html", "available": false}, {"title": "敲打", "file": "10526956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "反常", "file": "10526957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "失态", "file": "10526958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "干爹", "file": "10526959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "仙子", "file": "10526960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "望夫", "file": "10526961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "VIP章节 1", "file": "10526962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10526963.html", "available": false